{
  "name": "grid-dispatch",
  "vibe": "A Swiss-modernist dispatch sheet in motion. Flat off-white paper, near-black ink and ONE saturated accent — no gradients, no glass, no glow, zero corner radius. A visible six-column grid organises every frame; 2px rules draw themselves across it, accent poster fields wipe in on scaleX, and headline lines rise out of hard-edged masks. Screenshots ride technical asset panels with a spec header bar that states the slot and the aspect. A camera pushes into each composition and settles back before the cut, so every frame lands square on the grid. Authored portrait-first (9:16) as a native GSAP + DOM composition. Best for engineering, developer-tool, fintech, research and editorial brands that want authority and precision rather than spectacle.",
